# Spider-Punk's "Other Spiders you control have riot" covers tokens: a token created on the battlefield enters it (CR 111.1,
# 614.12a), so each has riot as it would enter. Bot1 web-slings Spiders-Man, Heroic Horde on turn 3; its two 2/1 Spider tokens
# each choose: haste for the first, the +1/+1 counter for the second. Spiders-Man is a Spider as well, and took the counter as
# it entered.

